# 📖 The Complete CCNA 200-301 Study Guide

A comprehensive **open-source** study guide for the Cisco **CCNA 200-301 v1.1** certification.

Unlike traditional certification books, this project teaches the **theory behind networking** before introducing Cisco commands, helping you develop the understanding needed to pass the exam and succeed in real-world networking.

---

## ⭐ Features

- Complete CCNA Exam Coverage
- Beginner Friendly
- Deep Technical Explanations
- High Quality Diagrams
- Binary Walkthroughs
- Packet Flow Illustrations
- Troubleshooting Sections
- Cisco IOS Configuration Examples
- Verification Commands
- Hands-on Packet Tracer Labs
- Practice Questions
- Exam Tips
- Cheat Sheets
- Flash Cards
- Interview Questions

